  "version": "6.0",
  "formatDescription": "The documents (files) created by Adobe Illustrator are PostScript language\r\ndocuments. A PostScript language document description that minimally conforms to the Document Structuring Conventions has two main parts: a prolog and a script. The prolog encapsulates information needed by other programs to interpret the file. The script describes the graphic elements on the page",
